WEBVTT

00:00:00.570 --> 00:00:04.070
Now, we're going to raise Kaleido Star's curtain.

00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:05.770
When you watch Kaleido Star,

00:00:05.770 --> 00:00:07.140
you should keep your room brightly lit

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:09.410
and sit as far from the TV as you can.

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:14.680
