00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:18.890
The reason my heart is pounding
and I can't slow it down...

00:00:18.890 --> 00:00:23.830
Right now I'm not her senior in the troupe,
nor am I her partner.

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:27.400
I stand before her as a rival.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:29.630
I've come back.

00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:32.300
Give me your best shot, Sora.

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:34.570
My name is Layla.

00:00:34.570 --> 00:00:38.630
Layla Hamilton, the Golden Phoenix.

