00:02:06.560 --> 00:02:08.090
<i>Tattoo Kiss</i>

00:02:06.560 --> 00:02:08.090
<i>Tattoo Kiss</i>

00:02:11.100 --> 00:02:13.470
The contest is on, Sora.

00:02:13.470 --> 00:02:15.800
If you don't like it, step down from your role.

00:02:19.910 --> 00:02:24.950
You said you'd practice more up until opening
day and aim to be a true Kaleido Star, correct?

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:27.350
If you can become one of those
just by practicing,

00:02:27.350 --> 00:02:29.750
I won't give up.

00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:34.450
I entrusted that dream to you because
I thought you had something that I didn't.

00:02:35.090 --> 00:02:37.680
You still hadn't figured that out?

00:02:38.460 --> 00:02:41.160
I've mastered the Angel's Maneuver too,

00:02:41.160 --> 00:02:43.500
in order to do battle with you.

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:45.930
I trust you'll consider me a worthy opponent.

00:02:45.930 --> 00:02:50.670
If you still decline the challenge,
you're nothing but a loser.

00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:54.180
If you have any intent of becoming
a true Kaleido Star,

00:02:54.180 --> 00:02:57.470
then surpass me, Sora.

00:02:58.310 --> 00:03:00.850
Battle Miss Layla for a role?

00:03:00.850 --> 00:03:05.620
My blood is starting to race
just thinking about it. Why?

00:03:05.990 --> 00:03:09.150
I can't hold back the desire to challenge her.

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:12.130
I like the look in your eyes.

00:03:12.130 --> 00:03:14.200
I take it you're up for the fight.

00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:15.390
Yes!

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:18.690
I'll see you tomorrow, then.

00:03:25.840 --> 00:03:26.310
A Most Amazing and Inescapable Showdown

00:03:26.310 --> 00:03:29.380
A Most Amazing and Inescapable Showdown

00:03:26.310 --> 00:03:29.380
"A Most Amazing and Inescapable Showdown"

00:03:29.380 --> 00:03:32.240
A Most Amazing and Inescapable Showdown

00:03:36.950 --> 00:03:38.590
One, two, three. One, two, three.

00:03:38.590 --> 00:03:40.490
Don't you find this strange?

00:03:38.590 --> 00:03:40.490
One, two, three. One, two, three.

00:03:40.490 --> 00:03:40.790
Huh? What do you mean?

00:03:40.490 --> 00:03:40.790
One, two, three. One, two, three.

00:03:40.790 --> 00:03:41.960
Huh? What do you mean?

00:03:40.790 --> 00:03:41.960
One, two, three. One, two...

00:03:41.960 --> 00:03:42.560
One, two, three. One, two...

00:03:42.560 --> 00:03:43.890
Nobody's talking about tomorrow.

00:03:42.560 --> 00:03:43.890
One, two, three. One, two...

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:45.290
Nobody's talking about tomorrow.

00:03:45.890 --> 00:03:47.400
Everyone's business as usual.

00:03:47.400 --> 00:03:50.560
It's like they don't care which one gets the lead.

00:03:50.900 --> 00:03:55.400
Maybe they really want both of them to be.

00:03:55.400 --> 00:03:56.870
So right now,

00:03:56.870 --> 00:04:00.140
nobody's got any choice but to do
what they need to be doing.

00:04:03.650 --> 00:04:05.850
No matter who ends up being the lead,

00:04:05.850 --> 00:04:09.810
now that you've decided to do this,
give your own role all you've got!

00:04:10.790 --> 00:04:14.550
You don't need to tell me that...

00:04:16.790 --> 00:04:20.130
I know it'll be hard to do with the time
and budget we have, but...

00:04:20.130 --> 00:04:23.290
This is IT! It definitely has to be this!

00:04:23.970 --> 00:04:25.970
The decision is yours.

00:04:25.970 --> 00:04:30.610
If we're going to do it, I'll start work right away,
even if it's just tearing down the current set.

00:04:30.610 --> 00:04:32.310
All right, let's do it.

00:04:32.310 --> 00:04:33.370
All right!

00:04:32.310 --> 00:04:33.370
Sweet!

00:04:33.780 --> 00:04:36.280
If you're going to do it, make it brilliant.

00:04:36.280 --> 00:04:38.510
Sure. Leave it to me.

00:04:38.880 --> 00:04:40.780
In order to make my debut as a clown,

00:04:40.780 --> 00:04:42.580
I absolutely MUST master this...

00:04:42.980 --> 00:04:44.750
How many times has it been?

00:04:44.750 --> 00:04:46.450
About a thousand?

00:04:46.450 --> 00:04:48.820
She's really staking everything
on this show, isn't she?

00:04:48.820 --> 00:04:50.260
Miss Anna!

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:51.230
Dammit!

00:04:59.870 --> 00:05:01.300
Please, stop this!

00:05:01.300 --> 00:05:03.000
You'll die, Miss Anna!

00:05:05.510 --> 00:05:08.910
I feel like I'll get the hang of it soon.

00:05:10.850 --> 00:05:14.220
I think we can stop here. Now get plenty of rest.

00:05:14.220 --> 00:05:15.880
Right!

00:05:15.880 --> 00:05:19.390
I thought you'd refuse her,
saying you didn't want to fight.

00:05:19.390 --> 00:05:23.090
I am contradictory, aren't l...

00:05:23.090 --> 00:05:25.920
But I can't hold back my feelings.

00:05:26.730 --> 00:05:32.670
Miss Layla is the one who taught me both
the fun and the harshness of the stage.

00:05:32.670 --> 00:05:35.340
She was always far ahead of me,

00:05:35.340 --> 00:05:37.840
and she became a goal for me to strive for.

00:05:37.840 --> 00:05:41.970
And now she's come back
to the stage as my rival.

00:05:42.410 --> 00:05:47.280
For Miss Layla, who left the Kaleido Stage
because of a shoulder injury,

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:51.880
it must have been so painful to master
the Angel's Maneuver...

00:05:52.420 --> 00:05:55.990
And so I want to go up against her
with all I've got.

00:05:55.990 --> 00:05:59.530
Miss Layla is special to me!

00:05:59.530 --> 00:06:03.630
Being able to meet Layla was your
greatest stroke of fortune, wasn't it.

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:05.370
Yes.

00:06:05.370 --> 00:06:08.930
Neither Sophie nor I had such good luck.

00:06:09.540 --> 00:06:14.440
But I was the one who tied Sophie down and
let all her possibilities go to waste.

00:06:14.440 --> 00:06:16.180
In order to atone for that,

00:06:16.180 --> 00:06:20.380
I continued to go out onto the stage
and I destroyed partner after partner

00:06:20.380 --> 00:06:22.080
in order to find a true star.

00:06:22.080 --> 00:06:23.990
I've committed so many wrongs.

00:06:23.990 --> 00:06:29.060
If a true star is realized,
I may at least be allowed to die.

00:06:29.060 --> 00:06:30.490
Mr. Leon!

00:06:46.410 --> 00:06:49.780
Leo turns its fangs on Sagittarius,

00:06:49.780 --> 00:06:52.980
its brightness increased to almost
ferocious brilliance.

00:06:52.980 --> 00:06:56.750
Did you come all the way here because
you were worried about Sora?

00:06:56.750 --> 00:07:00.090
Both constellations shine intensely.

00:07:00.090 --> 00:07:04.390
Their fate is that if they collide,
one of them must disappear.

00:07:04.390 --> 00:07:08.600
I thought I was a constellation
that had already disappeared.

00:07:08.600 --> 00:07:10.470
But at that moment...

00:07:10.470 --> 00:07:13.230
Ever since the moment I realized
I could still see you,

00:07:13.230 --> 00:07:15.760
I pondered what it meant.

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:23.080
I did think that the role left to me
might be to guide Sora on,

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:27.010
yet in the end my actions only caused
Sora to take a detour.

00:07:27.620 --> 00:07:32.650
But watching Sora regain her brilliance,
I realized...

00:07:32.650 --> 00:07:38.360
I still haven't been allowed to
step down from this stage.

00:07:38.360 --> 00:07:41.300
So I'll just return once more.

00:07:41.300 --> 00:07:44.200
Like May, who made her comeback
even after Leon wrecked her shoulder,

00:07:44.200 --> 00:07:46.130
I'll become a demon.

00:07:46.630 --> 00:07:52.710
However, this demon may end up
destroying the true Kaleido Star.

00:07:52.710 --> 00:07:55.010
We'll find that out tomorrow.

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:03.080
It's a beautiful day.

00:08:03.080 --> 00:08:05.620
I haven't been this excited in a long time!

00:08:05.620 --> 00:08:07.750
I'm on fire.

00:08:08.320 --> 00:08:09.760
It's strange...

00:08:09.760 --> 00:08:12.090
It's still a battle,

00:08:12.090 --> 00:08:15.300
but there's none of that pain
there was at the Festival.

00:08:15.300 --> 00:08:19.290
It's the opposite, I'm happy that I can fight!

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:24.060
Surpass me, Sora.

00:08:24.670 --> 00:08:28.040
With all I've got, so there's no regrets.

00:08:28.480 --> 00:08:31.140
But Mr. Leon is...

00:08:34.850 --> 00:08:37.350
We have an important audition today.

00:08:37.350 --> 00:08:39.250
Please take care not to get in the way of that.

00:08:39.520 --> 00:08:41.760
Now, eat!

00:08:41.760 --> 00:08:44.360
Um, but Chinese for breakfast is so...

00:08:44.360 --> 00:08:47.830
Eat this, power up, go at her head-on
and be crushed!

00:08:47.830 --> 00:08:49.900
Be crushed?!

00:08:49.900 --> 00:08:52.100
I don't want you losing too pathetically.

00:08:52.100 --> 00:08:54.400
Losing...

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:56.300
I'm looking forward to it.

00:08:56.300 --> 00:08:59.110
Not just seeing Miss Layla's Angel's Maneuver,

00:08:59.110 --> 00:09:01.480
but your Angel's Maneuver too.

00:09:01.480 --> 00:09:02.970
May!

00:09:04.250 --> 00:09:06.410
Now hurry up and eat already!

00:09:06.410 --> 00:09:07.550
It's bitter...

00:09:07.550 --> 00:09:09.080
Come on, eat this too!

00:09:09.080 --> 00:09:09.920
And this next!

00:09:09.920 --> 00:09:10.320
Spicy!

00:09:09.920 --> 00:09:10.320
And this next!

00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:10.750
Spicy!

00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:10.750
And this!

00:09:10.750 --> 00:09:10.950
And this!

00:09:10.950 --> 00:09:11.250
Hot!

00:09:10.950 --> 00:09:11.250
And this!

00:09:11.250 --> 00:09:11.590
Hot!

00:09:11.250 --> 00:09:11.590
And then this!

00:09:11.590 --> 00:09:12.050
And then this!

00:09:12.050 --> 00:09:12.320
It smells...

00:09:12.050 --> 00:09:12.320
And then this!

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:12.980
It smells...

00:09:14.020 --> 00:09:17.290
The Angel's Maneuver is said to
require innate instinct;

00:09:17.290 --> 00:09:19.990
I'm impressed you mastered to
this degree of perfection.

00:09:19.990 --> 00:09:23.590
If I couldn't do that, this contest
would be meaningless.

00:09:24.130 --> 00:09:25.770
I wonder when it was...

00:09:25.770 --> 00:09:26.930
What?

00:09:26.930 --> 00:09:30.470
I've felt this feeling before.

00:09:30.470 --> 00:09:33.610
Maybe it was the first time
I stood on the Kaleido Stage.

00:09:33.610 --> 00:09:36.940
Or maybe it was my first audition
for a lead role...

00:09:37.350 --> 00:09:40.510
Maybe the first time you pulled off
the Golden Phoenix.

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:43.550
I feel like those feelings were all
different than this.

00:09:43.550 --> 00:09:47.920
But my heart is dancing so much at
the thought of today's performance!

00:09:50.660 --> 00:09:52.330
Not long now, huh?

00:09:52.330 --> 00:09:53.130
Yeah.

00:09:53.130 --> 00:09:58.860
I wonder if the "true Kaleido Star"
you dreamed of will be born.

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:02.030
Nobody knows that.

00:10:04.610 --> 00:10:05.710
Kalos.

00:10:05.710 --> 00:10:06.740
What?

00:10:06.740 --> 00:10:07.940
Your socks.

00:10:12.850 --> 00:10:15.210
I love that about you.

00:10:15.780 --> 00:10:16.840
Let's go.

00:10:27.860 --> 00:10:29.460
This is thrilling.

00:10:29.460 --> 00:10:30.900
What do you think?

00:10:30.900 --> 00:10:35.100
Does it look like Sora will fulfill our dreams?

00:10:35.100 --> 00:10:37.440
I have high hopes for her.

00:10:37.440 --> 00:10:40.410
Then I'll set very high hopes for her too.

00:10:40.880 --> 00:10:45.440
There's a door that only those
who have kept on dreaming can open.

00:10:46.010 --> 00:10:47.240
Yes.

00:10:53.290 --> 00:10:56.560
Scene 32. The angel's flight.

00:10:56.560 --> 00:10:58.190
It's finally time.

00:10:58.190 --> 00:10:59.660
Yes.

00:11:03.730 --> 00:11:04.730
Mr. Leon.

00:11:04.730 --> 00:11:05.670
What?

00:11:05.670 --> 00:11:09.670
I think Miss Sophie was happy.

00:11:09.670 --> 00:11:13.270
You treasured her above everything else.

00:11:13.270 --> 00:11:17.110
I think Miss Sophie must have felt
that way about you too.

00:11:17.110 --> 00:11:23.150
I think maybe having someone you can
feel that way about is happiness.

00:11:23.150 --> 00:11:24.920
If I were Miss Sophie,

00:11:24.920 --> 00:11:29.250
I don't think I would want you to
suffer trying to atone.

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:35.800
If the stage is nothing but pain for you, Mr. Leon,

00:11:35.800 --> 00:11:39.000
you shouldn't go out onto it.

00:11:39.000 --> 00:11:42.030
I'll do this audition myself.

00:11:43.500 --> 00:11:46.960
If you're going onstage, do it for your own sake.

00:11:47.210 --> 00:11:49.140
For my own sake?

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:53.010
Let's go out there together and get
the best kind of applause.

00:11:53.010 --> 00:11:56.010
With a real Angel's Maneuver.

00:11:56.350 --> 00:12:00.080
The best kind of applause, with you...

00:12:02.260 --> 00:12:03.920
I'd like to hear that.

00:12:07.530 --> 00:12:09.260
It's about to start.

00:12:09.260 --> 00:12:10.630
Yes.

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:08.420
If I keep going straight down,
I think I'll hit trapeze A-2.

00:13:09.160 --> 00:13:10.630
I can tell.

00:13:10.630 --> 00:13:13.560
If I keep going straight down,
I'll hit trapeze A-5.

00:13:19.300 --> 00:13:20.490
Good.

00:13:33.850 --> 00:13:35.710
They're both perfect.

00:13:44.360 --> 00:13:47.090
On a technical level they're equal.

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:48.500
Yes.

00:13:48.500 --> 00:13:52.000
But Sora's Odette is lively and vigorous.

00:13:52.000 --> 00:13:56.040
Miss Layla kind of projects an air of innocence.

00:13:56.040 --> 00:13:57.910
That's Layla for you!

00:13:57.910 --> 00:14:01.210
To think after all this time, she's still
showing us a new side of her!

00:14:01.210 --> 00:14:03.410
I can't tell how this battle will play out.

00:14:03.410 --> 00:14:05.170
They're both great, aren't they?

00:14:06.050 --> 00:14:08.020
There's a huge amount of tension in the air.

00:14:08.020 --> 00:14:09.710
It feels like I'll start having trouble breathing.

00:14:15.460 --> 00:14:18.830
Good for you, Sora, coming this far.

00:14:18.830 --> 00:14:21.920
Now clear your own path on your own power.

00:14:22.860 --> 00:14:26.960
You're the first rival I've been able to
compete with on an equal level.

00:14:27.670 --> 00:14:30.900
I can feel your burning enthusiasm
all through my body.

00:14:31.840 --> 00:14:35.780
Back then, I never dreamed a day
like this would come.

00:14:36.880 --> 00:14:41.180
The first time I saw you perform,
I was actually angry, but...

00:14:41.950 --> 00:14:46.480
Someday, the audience will
come here just to see her.

00:14:47.250 --> 00:14:50.860
Kalos, it's just like you foresaw.

00:14:50.860 --> 00:14:57.130
No, actually, she probably overcame each
ordeal with more strength than you'd imagined.

00:14:57.530 --> 00:15:00.030
Then she became my partner,

00:15:00.030 --> 00:15:03.030
and now she's here as my rival.

00:15:03.870 --> 00:15:05.440
Sora...

00:15:05.440 --> 00:15:08.240
I want to win against you.

00:15:10.810 --> 00:15:14.440
When Miss Layla's onstage, the air crackles.

00:15:15.550 --> 00:15:18.990
Her true drive to utterly defeat me

00:15:18.990 --> 00:15:21.820
makes me even more fired up.

00:15:22.260 --> 00:15:26.320
If I lose my focus even a tiny bit, I'll lose.

00:15:29.130 --> 00:15:34.090
My Angel's Maneuver awakens
everyone's angel hearts.

00:15:34.500 --> 00:15:39.130
I have to perform my Angel's Maneuver!

00:15:44.850 --> 00:15:48.250
Hey, I know, why don't I try
performing more freely?

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:53.620
I'm going to put a little ad-lib in.

00:15:54.690 --> 00:15:55.710
Got it.

00:15:59.330 --> 00:16:01.230
Sora's performance has changed.

00:16:07.570 --> 00:16:12.400
The Angel's Maneuver is sure to awaken
everyone's angel hearts.

00:16:13.310 --> 00:16:16.500
My angel heart...

00:16:18.610 --> 00:16:21.740
The people who gave me an angel heart,

00:16:22.320 --> 00:16:25.120
my four parents...

00:16:25.120 --> 00:16:28.110
And Yume.

00:16:28.360 --> 00:16:31.720
Everyone must have people
