Huh?

00:18:04.550 --> 00:18:07.180
I just remembered my grandma.

00:18:07.620 --> 00:18:13.860
When I was little, I used to write all kinds of
stories for my grandma and tell them to her.

00:18:13.860 --> 00:18:18.300
I remembered how she used to smile
those times, like she was having fun.

00:18:18.800 --> 00:18:22.570
Actually, I was remembering the
first picture book I ever wrote.

00:18:22.570 --> 00:18:28.410
It was crap, but I remember
I gave it to a sick friend...

00:18:31.980 --> 00:18:33.500
I wonder why it is...

00:18:34.010 --> 00:18:37.590
I just remembered my first diabolo show.

00:18:37.590 --> 00:18:39.390
I screwed up a little,

00:18:39.390 --> 00:18:43.220
